														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4824450">
									

<p>I have had (though not in recent years) recurrent nightmares about the sea flooding the world. And perhaps not unlike the OP, I had an instance while playing in the sea and a big wave hit me. It couldt have carried me more than a foot ot two at the absolute outside (and only further up the beach in the direction I was looking), but the feeling of nearly being submerged and helplessness, momentary though it was, has stuck strongly with me to this day. So I totally grock that fear.</p>
<p>Have what, at time of posting, is your 100th upvote.</p>

