			<div class="content" id="post-content-4824448">
									

<p>It was an interesting twist on the standard pod person idea, using dead bodies instead of the usual live ones. Also, linking it back to SCP through the scientist looking to resurrect someone for a reason was interesting.</p>
<p>The only major flaw was that they were babies. They need to come out as adults (or whatever age the entity was at death) and there needs to be some memory transfer, albeit possibly corrupted due to decay, or they would be obvious, especially to loved ones.</p>

