			<div class="content" id="post-content-4824437">
									

<p>1) SCPs generally have some mystery to them; in that regard, I'm not sure if pointing out that there are nothing but mysteries surrounding an SCP works.</p>
<p>2) The SCP just has too many mysteries surrounding her; just some sort of direction (a Sarkic tattoo, a Marshall, Carter &amp; Dark receipt, basically just one clue to her past) would be appreciated.</p>
<p>3) Otherwise, while I agree that the &quot;rage and forget&quot; is cliche, I like the idea of a reptilian humanoid hiding as a human; it takes the &quot;social chameleon&quot; in an interesting direction.</p>

