<p>Zyn, I'm grateful for your warning regarding said &quot;rage state&quot; approach, and I can understand it might not be as interesting anymore. That being said, I'm not sure if there's much of an alternative approach. I really like both forms of the Red Girl and I want to implement both of them in my idea. What if I, for example, change them into two separate entities? Would that change the concept from the status quo?</p>

