<p>While I do agree with the points you laid out, I do feel as if focusing the story on the fight with the gator would pull the article away from its intended messege. This article is meant to be a small story that attempts to teach a simple leason. Be kind to your neihbors, and any details that didn't help push that lesson would feel ( to me at least ) superfluous. Also, on your point about the meanness feeling out of place. As someone who has lived in a small town in the south, while people tend to be friendlier, there is always gonna be asshole wherever you go. Especially if its a swamp full of outcasts and misfits.</p>

