			<div class="content" id="post-content-4824386">
									

<p>I can see this article is at about a 50/50 split right know between likes and dislikes. Judging the current trajectory, it'll probably slowly slip into the negatives. I know nobody is expected nor required to justify their votes, but I'd appreciate it if you could find the time to voice what didn't work for you, or what I could've done better.</p>
<p>This is my first SCP (and my first time writing fiction). I have a background in scientific writing, so I I didn't have too much trouble with the clinical tone. Is the narrative not strong enough? I really would like to improve and contribute something great to the site.</p>

